hun.m.chang@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2054640 - Clear CORS mode before MediaStream playback  a=RyanVM DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D313932\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D319633\n", "files": ["dom/html/HTMLMediaElement.cpp"], "git_node": "7ac42b883f50b209227cb44eb74550d1145e93f8", "git_parents": ["572bca60e94e742e9473a0ca48b5b439a4b0f8b5"], "node": "801fac0043e56cc92d4ac59634e167159a24d037", "parents": ["016e355012b8f98124d6fa694f5f2f823189b2e0"], "tags": []}], "date": 1787242074, "git_changesets": ["572bca60e94e742e9473a0ca48b5b439a4b0f8b5", "7ac42b883f50b209227cb44eb74550d1145e93f8"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "1506": {"changesets": [{"author": "Nicolas Silva \u003cnsilva@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2054652 - Check resource namespaces during displaylist building.  a=RyanVM\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D315537\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D320134\n", "files": ["gfx/layers/wr/AsyncImagePipelineManager.cpp", "gfx/layers/wr/WebRenderBridgeParent.cpp", "gfx/webrender_bindings/WebRenderAPI.cpp", "gfx/webrender_bindings/WebRenderAPI.h", "gfx/webrender_bindings/src/bindings.rs", "gfx/wr/example-compositor/compositor/src/main.rs", "gfx/wr/examples/common/boilerplate.rs", "gfx/wr/examples/document.rs", "gfx/wr/examples/iframe.rs", "gfx/wr/examples/multiwindow.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/render_api.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/scene.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/scene_builder_thread.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/scene_building.rs", "gfx/wr/wrench/src/rawtest.rs", "gfx/wr/wrench/src/wrench.rs"], "git_node": "24c5286b95f00f19605ab733bcc9e15ccf928e40", "git_parents": ["7ac42b883f50b209227cb44eb74550d1145e93f8"], "node": "808b3e6d59f0cc286c38eaed0f0482e5a5b299c7", "parents": ["801fac0043e56cc92d4ac59634e167159a24d037"], "tags": []}], "date": 1787242098, "git_changesets": ["24c5286b95f00f19605ab733bcc9e15ccf928e40"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "1507": {"changesets": [{"author": "Nicolas Silva \u003cnsilva@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2054652 - Fix WR examples build on older ESR branches. a=bustage\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D320189\n", "files": ["gfx/wr/examples/multiwindow.rs"], "git_node": "b36712811ccd0c151439b5c25c55efb147a35c40", "git_parents": ["24c5286b95f00f19605ab733bcc9e15ccf928e40"], "node": "08fe4eecad8b9af5c4d9d173c7b16f035b52d16f", "parents": ["808b3e6d59f0cc286c38eaed0f0482e5a5b299c7"], "tags": []}], "date": 1787247843, "git_changesets": ["b36712811ccd0c151439b5c25c55efb147a35c40"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "1508": {"changesets": [{"author": "David Parks \u003cdaparks@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2059027 - Create the DLL blocklist shared section with an empty DACL.  a=RyanVM DONTBUILD\n\nSharedSection::Init() creates the section with no security descriptor.\nGive the object a present-but-empty DACL, as ipc/glue does for freezable\nshared memory.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D318252\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D319962\n", "files": ["browser/app/winlauncher/freestanding/SharedSection.cpp", "browser/app/winlauncher/freestanding/moz.build", "browser/app/winlauncher/test/TestCrossProcessWin.cpp", "browser/app/winlauncher/test/moz.build"], "git_node": "cae4777a10b67948245e50e047deb6c7375db6f6", "git_parents": ["b36712811ccd0c151439b5c25c55efb147a35c40"], "node": "43e2cfe2c10013097787f14493f17a8e022f0166", "parents": ["08fe4eecad8b9af5c4d9d173c7b16f035b52d16f"], "tags": []}], "date": 1787261422, "git_changesets": ["cae4777a10b67948245e50e047deb6c7375db6f6"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "1509": {"changesets": [{"author": "Matthew Gregan \u003ckinetik@flim.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2061220, Bug 2058051 - Backport cubeb WASAPI output channel count and WinMM stream destroy fixes.  a=RyanVM DONTBUILD\n\nThis branch pins an older libcubeb revision, so the two fixes are carried as\nlocal vendoring patches rather than a full libcubeb update:\n\n- wasapi-output-mix-channel-count.patch: upstream cubeb dc56ea41 and f0bd97db\n  (mozilla/cubeb#856), bug 2061220.  Creates the output mixer when the device\n  mix channel count differs from the stream channel count, and rejects stream\n  params whose layout and channel count disagree.\n- winmm-destroy-work-item-uaf.patch: upstream cubeb f6b59a3b\n  (mozilla/cubeb#854), bug 2058051.  Counts pending buffer thread work items\n  per stream and in-flight driver callbacks per context so stream and context\n  destruction wait for them to drain.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D319947\n", "files": ["media/libcubeb/moz.yaml", "media/libcubeb/src/cubeb.c", "media/libcubeb/src/cubeb_wasapi.cpp", "media/libcubeb/src/cubeb_winmm.c", "media/libcubeb/test/test_sanity.cpp", "media/libcubeb/wasapi-output-mix-channel-count.patch", "media/libcubeb/winmm-destroy-work-item-uaf.patch"], "git_node": "e391af006c9c04eb71170831b4a6dc442204b66b", "git_parents": ["cae4777a10b67948245e50e047deb6c7375db6f6"], "node": "16b1832d173355d1bbcb92dc74bc48de47bfde40", "parents": ["43e2cfe2c10013097787f14493f17a8e022f0166"], "tags": []}], "date": 1787261446, "git_changesets": ["e391af006c9c04eb71170831b4a6dc442204b66b"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "1510": {"changesets": [{"author": "Vincent Hilla \u003cvhilla@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2055693 - Remove dead javascript: URI handling in LoadHistoryEntry.  a=RyanVM DONTBUILD\n\nPer spec, javascript: URIs are never stored in SH. Neither has this code test\ncoverage, nor does the test on the bug that introduced it still pass.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D314860\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D319688\n", "files": ["docshell/base/nsDocShell.cpp", "docshell/shistory/SessionHistoryEntry.cpp"], "git_node": "2b9574161b00fe4ad4fa1d3c53992dfc5b6cc178", "git_parents": ["e391af006c9c04eb71170831b4a6dc442204b66b"], "node": "8f36cd5a52d713c828d8405ed5473b006a1259c2", "parents": ["16b1832d173355d1bbcb92dc74bc48de47bfde40"], "tags": []}], "date": 1787261470, "git_changesets": ["2b9574161b00fe4ad4fa1d3c53992dfc5b6cc178"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "1511": {"changesets": [{"author": "Lee Salzman \u003clsalzman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2060008.  a=RyanVM DONTBUILD\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D319678\n", "files": ["gfx/2d/DrawTargetCairo.cpp"], "git_node": "fb5c76893778bc2f1d9bededcc39be7c479f520d", "git_parents": ["2b9574161b00fe4ad4fa1d3c53992dfc5b6cc178"], "node": "22c81a1ebe298199ef93d282c8d6ac4d63432134", "parents": ["8f36cd5a52d713c828d8405ed5473b006a1259c2"], "tags": []}], "date": 1787261492, "git_changesets": ["fb5c76893778bc2f1d9bededcc39be7c479f520d"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "1512": {"changesets": [{"author": "Olli Pettay \u003cOlli.Pettay@helsinki.fi\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2057817 - ensure browser id handling is consistent,  a=RyanVM DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D318490\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D319966\n", "files": ["docshell/base/BrowsingContext.cpp"], "git_node": "e11b67da49ec8abf57cf0ad58340fd61c49ca6f7", "git_parents": ["fb5c76893778bc2f1d9bededcc39be7c479f520d"], "node": "39cdc5b4b5ca50548247717c0717c227dfdacd20", "parents": ["22c81a1ebe298199ef93d282c8d6ac4d63432134"], "tags": []}], "date": 1787261515, "git_changesets": ["e11b67da49ec8abf57cf0ad58340fd61c49ca6f7"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "1513": {"changesets": [{"author": "Eitan Isaacson \u003ceitan@monotonous.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2058652 - Don't truncate actor ID.  a=Ryan